            "description": "One or more comma-separated cryptocurrency symbols. Example: \"BTC,ETH\". A symbol can name several coins: each comes back as a list of every coin using it, inactive ones included, so read the entry with is_active 1 and the lowest cmc_rank, or pass slug or id to name one coin.",
